(7679814, 1256398, 4388, '<td valign="top">Nice windows, steeple, and perspective on the building, but when I first looked at the image I saw bushes, a temporary sign, and a brick wall.</td>', 'Nice windows, steeple, and perspective on the building, but when I first looked at the image I saw bushes, a temporary sign, and a brick wall.', '2020-11-20 23:06:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7679816, 1256390, 4388, '<td valign="top">I love the white steeple in the middle of the image with greens and yellows, then the image recedes to the distance with the darkish sky with white and gray clouds. You have a subject, setting and depth. Nice image!</td>', 'I love the white steeple in the middle of the image with greens and yellows, then the image recedes to the distance with the darkish sky with white and gray clouds. You have a subject, setting and depth. Nice image!', '2020-11-20 23:08:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7679818, 1256389, 4388, '<td valign="top">Technically you are correct that nature is a Holy Place, but the image lacks interest.</td>', 'Technically you are correct that nature is a Holy Place, but the image lacks interest.', '2020-11-20 23:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7679821, 1256359, 4388, '<td valign="top">To me, the crown is the most interesting part of the image. Maybe somehow getting that part of the building closer to the center of the image would make it more striking.</td>', 'To me, the crown is the most interesting part of the image. Maybe somehow getting that part of the building closer to the center of the image would make it more striking.', '2020-11-20 23:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7679822, 1256379, 4388, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and minimalism in the image. Nice!</td>', 'I like the colors and minimalism in the image. Nice!', '2020-11-20 23:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7679823, 1256260, 4388, '<td valign="top">Looks HDR. Very striking image. Good framing and placement of subject. Nice job!</td>', 'Looks HDR. Very striking image. Good framing and placement of subject. Nice job!', '2020-11-20 23:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7679825, 1256347, 4388, '<td valign="top">Nice grayscale image and perspective. Good eye!</td>', 'Nice grayscale image and perspective. Good eye!', '2020-11-20 23:24:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7679826, 1256131, 4388, '<td valign="top">Looks HDR with the shadows showing so much detail. Nice image.</td>', 'Looks HDR with the shadows showing so much detail. Nice image.', '2020-11-20 23:25:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7679827, 1256322, 4388, '<td valign="top">I don''t know which processing did it, but the lighter edges around the top of the building distract from this image. I really like the perspective and overall quality of the image.</td>', 'I don''t know which processing did it, but the lighter edges around the top of the building distract from this image. I really like the perspective and overall quality of the image.', '2020-11-20 23:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7679828, 1256399, 4388, '<td valign="top">Very interesting image but I find myself looking straight at a brick wall. Maybe a wider angle or different perspective with more of the red and gold sticks in the image?</td>', 'Very interesting image but I find myself looking straight at a brick wall. Maybe a wider angle or different perspective with more of the red and gold sticks in the image?', '2020-11-20 23:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7679829, 1256368, 4388, '<td valign="top">You used the rule of thirds but there is still a little too much negative space on the right side of the image. Nice lighting and tones!</td>', 'You used the rule of thirds but there is still a little too much negative space on the right side of the image. Nice lighting and tones!', '2020-11-20 23:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7679830, 1256356, 4388, '<td valign="top">Nice exposure and lighting. Good color. Maybe get a little closer to eliminate having too much grass in the overall image.</td>', 'Nice exposure and lighting. Good color. Maybe get a little closer to eliminate having too much grass in the overall image.', '2020-11-20 23:40:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7679831, 1256294, 4388, '<td valign="top">I really like the perspective and toning. The leaves look nice. The brick in the center catches my eye a little too much. Might be better if the peak of the church roof was 1/3 of the way down the image? Overall nice image!</td>', 'I really like the perspective and toning. The leaves look nice. The brick in the center catches my eye a little too much. Might be better if the peak of the church roof was 1/3 of the way down the image? Overall nice image!', '2020-11-20 23:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7679832, 1256361, 4388, '<td valign="top">Not sure what to look at in this image. I like the church and steeple. The outbuilding on the right is cool. The people on the left are ok. Maybe they could be the subject from a different angle. The house on the far left is distracting.</td>', 'Not sure what to look at in this image. I like the church and steeple. The outbuilding on the right is cool. The people on the left are ok. Maybe they could be the subject from a different angle. The house on the far left is distracting.', '2020-11-20 23:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
